  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-d55053a568e9eda3df39eff3",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "奈奎斯特图显示了与幅值=1圆的三个穿越频率，对应三个相角裕度（PM）值。伯德图显示在0.75、9.0和10.1 rad/sec处有三次幅值=1的穿越，相角裕度分别为37°、80°和40°。关键的稳定性指标是奈奎斯特图与-1点的接近程度。存在一次实轴穿越，因而有一个幅值裕度（GM）。由伯德图可知，在幅值=0.79的ω=10.4 rad/sec处，相位穿越-180°，因此GM=1/0.79=1.26。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The Nyquist plot shows three crossover frequencies of the magnitude=1 circle, corresponding to three PM values. The Bode plot shows three magnitude=1 crossings at 0.75, 9.0, and 10.1 rad/sec with PMs of 37°, 80°, and 40° respectively. The key stability indicator is the proximity of the Nyquist plot to the -1 point. There is one real-axis crossing, hence one GM. From the Bode plot, phase crosses -180° at ω=10.4 rad/sec where magnitude=0.79, so GM=1/0.79=1.26.",
